#: src/components/Projects.tsx:21
msgid "A sophisticated crypto alerting app with a deceptively simple UI. Users specify combinations of technical alerts like \"RSI > 70\" and \"5m Price > 5m Bollinger Upper\" to create trading signals. The backend system processes live tick data from various crypto exchanges, enriches the data in Flink to calculate indicators, and evaluates user rules in Drools to determine when an alert has been satisfied. Notifications are delivered via push, email, Discord, or Telegram, with automated trading coming soon."
msgstr "A sophisticated crypto alerting app with a deceptively simple UI. Users specify combinations of technical alerts like \"RSI > 70\" and \"5m Price > 5m Bollinger Upper\" to create trading signals. The backend system processes live tick data from various crypto exchanges, enriches the data in Flink to calculate indicators, and evaluates user rules in Drools to determine when an alert has been satisfied. Notifications are delivered via push, email, Discord, or Telegram, with automated trading coming soon."

