#: src/components/Projects.tsx:30
msgid "Invoiced.ai empowers small businesses to manage accounts payable and receivable. Business owners can track time, import time from ClickUp/Asana/Monday, configure recurring or auto-billing AR invoices, track inventory, dynamically mark up products based on weighted vendor costs, visualize their financials with customizable graphs, accept online payments with Stripe, offer their clients a management portal, and many other features to help small businesses manage finances smoothly."
msgstr "Invoiced.ai empowers small businesses to manage accounts payable and receivable. Business owners can track time, import time from ClickUp/Asana/Monday, configure recurring or auto-billing AR invoices, track inventory, dynamically mark up products based on weighted vendor costs, visualize their financials with customizable graphs, accept online payments with Stripe, offer their clients a management portal, and many other features to help small businesses manage finances smoothly."

