#: src/components/Projects.tsx:57
msgid "Popular FFXIV overlay with real-time combat data processing and robust customization. Has 30,000 monthly users and is the only one of its kind to offer highly flexible data customizations including a detailed player view with performance graphs. Offers a spell timer feature which can be used alongside the data overlay to alert users when important spells will soon be ready to use, with the data necessary for this extracted and compiled with C# and Python programs."
msgstr "Popular FFXIV overlay with real-time combat data processing and robust customization. Has 30,000 monthly users and is the only one of its kind to offer highly flexible data customizations including a detailed player view with performance graphs. Offers a spell timer feature which can be used alongside the data overlay to alert users when important spells will soon be ready to use, with the data necessary for this extracted and compiled with C# and Python programs."

